message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Secure Autonomous Agents in SAP Systems: A Control-Property Review Evaluated on a Reconstructed SAP FI Authorization Model"
abstract: >-
  A diagnostic instrument, the Control-Property Review, applied to autonomous
  AI agents acting inside a reconstructed SAP FI authorization surface. For a
  named control and a named property, it asks whether that control can decide
  the property at all, and answers with pre-registered experiments whose every
  figure and number is generated from the code. Version 1.0, an independent
  study with its external validation stated openly.
